样活着，到底图个啥？这么多年，也没人问过我累不累。","说累，好像显得我多没用似的。"]},"conversation":{"type":"心理健康维护","topic":"用户因失业、经济压力和家庭支持缺失而感到心理困扰，出现早醒、情绪低落、无意义感等表现，并习惯压抑情绪。"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6761bf4429d1fd72f77b6","chatId":"ec1f309f2c874a9c95e57e42a9a599c6","sessionId":null,"userId":99849,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“这么多年，没人问过我累不累”——这句话我听着心里发酸。你一个人撑了太久，连自己都快忘了累是可以说的。图个啥这问题，我没法替你答。我想先问一句：如果今天有人认真问你累不累，你会怎么回答他？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“这么多年，没人问过我累不累”——这句话我听着心里发酸。你一个人撑了太久，连自己都快忘了累是可以说的。图个啥这问题，我没法替你答。我想先问一句：如果今天有人认真问你累不累，你会怎么回答他？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2428,"promptTokens":3249,"completionTokens":135,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.34849369756927573,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6761bf4429d1fd72f77b5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536987077,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6761bf4429d1fd72f77b5","chatId":"ec1f309f2c874a9c95e57e42a9a599c6","sessionId":null,"userId":99849,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"硬挨着呗……有时候喝两口，有时候就躺着看天花板。（顿了顿）你说，像我这样活着，到底图个啥？这么多年，也没人问过我累不累。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent"